Subject: Select original graphics frame state and lifecycle

Upstream-base: 01c9a4d61904afc927d6752c3cd29fca489ff5cc

Extract the original begin/end/send/discard/finish entry points and their state
from gl.cpp for explicit native source selection. Retain discard-max semantics,
view reset and successful-send counter ordering. Native guards enforce host frame
ownership and unwind cleanup; reject counter exhaustion before signed overflow.
The port supplies real Aurora rendering/presentation and drained frame-pool reuse.
This does not select glStartup or the full BeginFrameTask/EndFrameTask graph.

